flowchart TD
    goal["Increase verified useful purchases<br/>subject to financial safety and operating cost"]
    quality["Assembly<br/>configuration task completion<br/>false-feasible and unknown rates"]
    authority["PayGuard<br/>unauthorized effects observed<br/>legitimate actions incorrectly blocked"]
    reliability["Counterexample<br/>verified defects + reproducibility<br/>time to useful regression"]
    outcomes["Merchant outcomes<br/>paid purchase completion / returns<br/>support effort / repeat usage"]
    cost["Operating guardrails<br/>model and browser usage<br/>provider calls / infrastructure / support"]
    net["Merchant contribution measurement<br/>revenue less relevant costs, fees and realized losses<br/>requires actual cost and cohort data"]
    pilot["Controlled pilot / comparable cohorts<br/>define denominators and observation windows<br/>measure false blocks as well as failures"]
    goal --> quality
    goal --> authority
    goal --> reliability
    quality -->|hypothesized mechanism| outcomes
    authority -->|hypothesized mechanism| outcomes
    reliability -->|hypothesized mechanism| outcomes
    outcomes --> net
    cost --> net
    pilot -->|actual evidence required| net
